    repoRoot: string,
    preSha: string,
    postSha: string,
  ): Promise<{ status: "pass" | "missing" | "dormant" }>;
  /**
   * Lint-VERIFICATION gate — the instrument behind `checkLintCert`'s verdict.
   *
   * WHY IT EXISTS (issue #931). The cert gate above only proves the implementer
   * WROTE `SANDCASTLE-LINT: pass`, so an agent that stamped its own commit
   * `SANDCASTLE-LINT: n/a` had its correct, tested, finished work quarantined
   * for a paperwork slip while lint was in fact green. Trusting an agent's
   * self-report about the linter was the wrong instrument in both directions:
   * the loop can RUN the linter and know. This runs the project's own `pnpm
