   * builder's, and never trusted from a log of what the builder claimed to
   * run. Encapsulates the WHOLE flow: execute the check (with the one
   * allowed re-run — see `lib/harness/run-harness-check.ts`), locate and
   * store the receipt picture when one was taken, and raise the alarm
   * (`lib/harness/alarm.ts`) on the two conditions Piece F/G name loudly:
   * the page never settled, or a picture was taken but could not be filed.
