     * Used for one thing: naming the persisted check-run transcript
     * (`lib/harness/check-run-log.ts`) so it lands beside that issue's OWN
     * agent session logs in `.sandcastle/logs/`, which is where anybody
     * investigating a stopped ticket already looks. Optional so the many test
     * doubles that call this dep are unaffected; when it is absent no
     * transcript is written and nothing else changes.
